WEBVTT

00:07:28.673 --> 00:07:32.374
kuulizia kiburi cha ustahi.

00:07:33.645 --> 00:07:37.898
Kimaadili,nastahiki talanta
zinazoniwezesha kunawiri ?

00:07:38.533 --> 00:07:40.467
Ni uwezo wangu

00:07:40.491 --> 00:07:44.133
kua naishi katika jamii
inayothamini talanta

00:07:44.157 --> 00:07:45.875
ninazo ?

00:07:46.315 --> 00:07:48.315
Ama ni bahati ?

00:07:49.042 --> 00:07:52.883
Kusisitiza ufanisi ni haki yangu

00:07:52.907 --> 00:07:57.255
huleta ugumu kujiweka 
kwa niaba ya watu wengine.

00:07:58.188 --> 00:08:01.029
Kuthamini nafasi ya baraka maishani